From 4d077838dd699149a58708e2756af44982f1f6a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mcc45tr <mcc45tr@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 20:13:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 30/30] media: qcom: adapt current Nabu Iris overlay to Linux
 7.2.2

Synchronize the CFM880/nabu-iris overlay at ea39fff onto the 6.17-derived port, enable its composable Iris and Iris-camera DTBs, and adapt the V4L2 file-handle API used by Linux 7.2.2.

Original work: ChengFangming <chengfangming1993@gmail.com>

Source: https://github.com/CFM880/nabu-iris

Source revision: ea39fff3811e6f3c05d735b147bfb5eca90ec03f
